            ^"Abilities" STRING "Artes Liberales 2 (grammar), Awareness 1 (faerie trickery), Craft: Linen 4 (clothes), Craft: Wool 4 (felt), Concentration 2 (Herbam), Faerie Lore 1 (spiders), Finesse 4+2 (craft magic), Folk Ken 2 (craftsmen), Latin 4 (Hermetic), Magic Theory 5 (craft magic), Low German 5 (Flemish), Parma Magica 2 (faerie powers), Penetration 2 (Animal), Profession: Dyer 2 (reds), Second Sight 2 (faerie glamour)"
