            ^"Activities in the last 15 years" STRING "Julia has invented 93 levels of spells. She has not spent any time creating magical items, since her Craft Magic allows her to duplicate simple effect in days rather than seasons. She has also acquired 197 experience points in Arts and 160 experience points in Abilities."
